  "prefLabel": "Agr 3901.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 3901.01 Purpose. These rules implement the procedures of the department of agriculture, markets and food, pursuant to RSA 426-A:6 for the inspection of farms engaged in covered activities including the growing, harvesting, packing, and holding of covered produce in accordance with the Food Safety Modernization Act, 21 C.F.R. Part 112, 2016.\n\nSource. #12822, eff 7-3-19; ss by #13131, eff 11-18-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr3900.html"
